    <string name="collection_title">Nursery · %1$d of %2$d</string>
    <string name="collection_odds">Every day a new pet comes as an egg, never one you have. Common ones come most often, legendary ones rarely, mythic ones almost never. Tap an egg to put it on the matrix, tap a pet to see its three forms.</string>
